        "description": "The story begins in the floating city of Aerilon, where Kira uncovers a mysterious crystal tied to a lost order of guardians. Her discovery disrupts the fragile peace, revealing hidden truths about the Cataclysm. Forced to flee after a confrontation with Enforcers, she steps into a world far larger than she imagined, leaving safety behind. This act establishes the core mystery and sets her on an irreversible path."
